  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Most of the common Video Player prefabs are using a combination of UI elements' OnClick or OnEndEdit events to add the URL to a video player, and VRC_Triggers to clear/stop the player.\n\nThe problem is that the order of the UI events is not respected so it creates a race condition between which can trigger faster: \n\nIf the VRC_Trigger wins the race, it works because it clears, then the new URL is added.\n\nIf the UI Event wins the race, then the URL is added, then immediately cleared along with whatever else was in the player.\n\n\nhttps://answers.unity.com/questions/1398221/how-to-re-arrange-button-onclick-event-in-unity.html\n\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/solved-unityevent-invoke-calling-order.265292/#post-1753393\n\nNot sure if this is a bug or a feature request, but it would be nice to have a way to consistently add a URL to the video player without having to keep trying until the trigger wins the race.",
